    "body": "The maintainer added this requirement (2026-11-18): the wasm build, the macOS package and the Linux tarball are first-class artifacts.\n\n- The core release run builds and publishes these three, together with the Windows zip and the installer.\n- The core release is complete only when these artifacts are attached. A secondary workflow never builds them.\n- A failure of one of these jobs makes the core run red. A failure of a secondary format does not.\n- The site, `/app/` (wasm) and the download page must not wait for a secondary workflow.\n\nThis changes point 1 of the issue body: the core set is wasm, macOS, the Linux tarball, the Windows zip and installer, and the site. AUR, RPM, DEB, snap, flatpak and the other formats are secondary.\n",
